; XAUUSD_Loma_TrendPullback v1.35 on BTCUSD - best trailing of M2 (tick replay): ATRentry trailing (TrailMode 1), setup 3 of 3: sell, session 1200-1630 server time, trend filter D1 EMA 20, target 1R. DO NOT LOAD ON GOLD.
; Trailing: 0.5 x ATR(14) of M2 at entry behind the best price once the profit reaches 3 x ATR, stop moved once per closed minute. Needs EA v1.35 or later (TrailMode 1, TrailParam 0).
; Picked on Jan 2025 - May 15 2026 only, by the one-minute backtest at the study's costs (10 USD spread; score 1.31): 78 trades, PF 1.66. Tick replay of the same months: 78 trades, PF 1.68.
; TICK REPLAY (every tick, the EA's rules; Binance BTCUSDT one-second prices with a 10 USD spread, no commission). Unseen May 16 - Nov 13 2026: this setup 26 trades, PF 1.70, net +4.4R (stressed PF 1.43); the 3 setups of M2 + ATRentry together 121 trades, PF 1.97, net +19.5R (stressed 1.53).
; ATRentry was chosen as the best of the EA's trailing systems on M2 by that 2026 result: the 2026 figure is the score it was chosen by, not a test.
